<urn:atm:triage:finding/AI29-RBQA-001>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "AI29-RBQA-001" ;
  triage:title "RuntimeConfigDoctor::inspect_config reads .atm.toml unguarded by WorkspaceConfigAccess" ;
  triage:description "RuntimeConfigDoctor::inspect_config (composition.rs:73-82) independently calls load_atm_config, completely unguarded by the new WorkspaceConfigAccess/for_daemon() toggle from commit 40ed45e2. Wired into daemon via doctor_ports (composition.rs:101) and runtime_health.rs:791. Daemon DOES still read caller-supplied .atm.toml on doctor path, defeating the fix claim and issue #636." ;
